					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{}0\\,\\end{dmath*}"
				}
			],
			"source": "chk:= @(comm) - 1/4 R_{\\mu\\nu}^{m n} \\Gamma_{m n} \\psi_{\\rho};\nsubstitute(chk, Rdef)\ndistribute(chk)\nsort_product(chk)\ncanonicalise(chk)\nrename_dummies(chk)\ncollect_terms(chk);"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 5014460475085604179,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "latex",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 5014460475085604179,
					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "\\subsection*{The action}\n\nThe action is the sum of the Hilbert action $\\mathcal{L}^{(2)}$ and the Rarita-Schwinger action\n$\\mathcal{L}^{(3/2)}$ (vN~1.7 eq.~(1)). We keep the two parts separate, so we can follow\nwhich terms in the variation cancel against which. In vN the Hilbert action is written\nas $-\\tfrac12 e\\, e^{a\\nu} e^{b\\mu} R_{\\mu\\nu ab}$:"
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "\\subsection*{The action}\n\nThe action is the sum of the Hilbert action $\\mathcal{L}^{(2)}$ and the Rarita-Schwinger action\n$\\mathcal{L}^{(3/2)}$ (vN~1.7 eq.~(1)). We keep the two parts separate, so we can follow\nwhich terms in the variation cancel against which. In vN the Hilbert action is written\nas $-\\tfrac12 e\\, e^{a\\nu} e^{b\\mu} R_{\\mu\\nu ab}$:"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 3413071379190433056,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "input",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 2332521986876752520,
					"cell_origin": "server",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"cells": [
						{
							"cell_id": 8882940155169786358,
							"cell_origin": "server",
							"cell_type": "input_form",
							"source": " -  1/2 e e_{m}^{\\nu} e_{n}^{\\mu} R_{\\mu \\nu}^{m n}"
						}
					],
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{} - \\frac{1}{2}\\,e e_{m}\\,^{\\nu} e_{n}\\,^{\\mu} R_{\\mu \\nu}\\,^{m n}\\end{dmath*}"
				}
			],
			"source": "L2:= -1/2 e e_{m}^{\\nu} e_{n}^{\\mu} R_{\\mu\\nu}^{m n};"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 1920814257899668885,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "latex",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 1920814257899668885,
					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "vN writes the gravitino action as\n$-\\tfrac12\\epsilon^{\\mu\\nu\\rho\\sigma}\\bar\\psi_\\mu\\gamma_5\\gamma_\\nu D_\\rho\\psi_\\sigma$.\nIn four dimensions $\\epsilon^{\\mu\\nu\\rho\\sigma}\\gamma_5\\gamma_\\nu$ is proportional to\n$e\\,\\Gamma^{\\mu\\rho\\sigma}$, so we can write the action without $\\gamma_5$ or an epsilon\ntensor. The overall normalisation of this term relative to $\\mathcal{L}^{(2)}$ is checked\nlater, when the Einstein tensor terms of the two parts have to cancel.\nThe curved indices on the gamma matrix are converted to flat ones, so that the vielbeine\nappear explicitly and can be varied."
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "vN writes the gravitino action as\n$-\\tfrac12\\epsilon^{\\mu\\nu\\rho\\sigma}\\bar\\psi_\\mu\\gamma_5\\gamma_\\nu D_\\rho\\psi_\\sigma$.\nIn four dimensions $\\epsilon^{\\mu\\nu\\rho\\sigma}\\gamma_5\\gamma_\\nu$ is proportional to\n$e\\,\\Gamma^{\\mu\\rho\\sigma}$, so we can write the action without $\\gamma_5$ or an epsilon\ntensor. The overall normalisation of this term relative to $\\mathcal{L}^{(2)}$ is checked\nlater, when the Einstein tensor terms of the two parts have to cancel.\nThe curved indices on the gamma matrix are converted to flat ones, so that the vielbeine\nappear explicitly and can be varied."
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 3279525101560688823,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "input",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 3966397514781623942,
					"cell_origin": "server",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"cells": [
						{
							"cell_id": 6022130471651236587,
							"cell_origin": "server",
							"cell_type": "input_form",
							"source": " -  1/2 e \\bar{\\psi_{\\mu}} \\Gamma^{\\mu \\nu \\rho} D_{\\nu}(\\psi_{\\rho})"
						}
					],
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{} - \\frac{1}{2}\\,e \\bar{\\psi_{\\mu}} \\Gamma^{\\mu \\nu \\rho} D_{\\nu}{\\psi_{\\rho}}\\end{dmath*}"
				},
				{
					"cell_id": 14620951963464074780,
					"cell_origin": "server",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"cells": [
						{
							"cell_id": 5834651223266015881,
							"cell_origin": "server",
							"cell_type": "input_form",
							"source": " -  1/2 e \\bar{\\psi_{\\mu}} \\Gamma^{m n p} D_{\\nu}(\\psi_{\\rho}) e_{m}^{\\mu} e_{n}^{\\nu} e_{p}^{\\rho}"
						}
					],
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{} - \\frac{1}{2}\\,e \\bar{\\psi_{\\mu}} \\Gamma^{m n p} D_{\\nu}{\\psi_{\\rho}} e_{m}\\,^{\\mu} e_{n}\\,^{\\nu} e_{p}\\,^{\\rho}\\end{dmath*}"
				}
			],
			"source": "L32:= -1/2 e \\bar{\\psi_{\\mu}} \\Gamma^{\\mu\\nu\\rho} D_{\\nu}{\\psi_{\\rho}};\nrewrite_indices(_, $\\Gamma^{m n p}$, $e_{m}^{\\mu}$);"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 889822531485330783,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "latex",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 889822531485330783,
					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "\\subsection*{Transformation rules}\n\nFrom $\\delta e^m{}_\\mu = \\tfrac12\\bar\\epsilon\\Gamma^m\\psi_\\mu$ and $\\delta(e^m{}_\\mu e_n{}^\\mu)=0$\nit follows that the inverse vielbein transforms as\n$\\delta e_m{}^\\mu = -e_m{}^\\nu\\,(\\delta e^n{}_\\nu)\\, e_n{}^\\mu$. The variation of the\ndeterminant is $\\delta e = e\\, e_m{}^\\mu\\delta e^m{}_\\mu$. These are the explicit\nvielbeine of vN~1.7 eq.~(1). The gravitini are varied separately, later."
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "\\subsection*{Transformation rules}\n\nFrom $\\delta e^m{}_\\mu = \\tfrac12\\bar\\epsilon\\Gamma^m\\psi_\\mu$ and $\\delta(e^m{}_\\mu e_n{}^\\mu)=0$\nit follows that the inverse vielbein transforms as\n$\\delta e_m{}^\\mu = -e_m{}^\\nu\\,(\\delta e^n{}_\\nu)\\, e_n{}^\\mu$. The variation of the\ndeterminant is $\\delta e = e\\, e_m{}^\\mu\\delta e^m{}_\\mu$. These are the explicit\nvielbeine of vN~1.7 eq.~(1). The gravitini are varied separately, later."
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 8714237158517167456,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "input",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 1556463670173196053,
					"cell_origin": "server",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"cells": [
						{
							"cell_id": 11659552000276077405,
							"cell_origin": "server",
							"cell_type": "input_form",
							"source": "{e_{m}^{\\mu} ->  -  1/2 \\bar{\\epsilon} \\Gamma^{n} \\psi_{\\nu} e_{m}^{\\nu} e_{n}^{\\mu}, e ->  1/2 e \\bar{\\epsilon} \\Gamma^{m} \\psi_{\\mu} e_{m}^{\\mu}}"
						}
					],
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{}\\left[e_{m}\\,^{\\mu} \\rightarrow  - \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\bar{\\epsilon} \\Gamma^{n} \\psi_{\\nu} e_{m}\\,^{\\nu} e_{n}\\,^{\\mu}, \\discretionary{}{}{}e \\rightarrow \\frac{1}{2}\\,e \\bar{\\epsilon} \\Gamma^{m} \\psi_{\\mu} e_{m}\\,^{\\mu}\\right]\\end{dmath*}"
				}
			],
			"source": "dvb:= { e_{m}^{\\mu} -> -1/2 \\bar{\\epsilon}\\Gamma^{n}\\psi_{\\nu} e_{m}^{\\nu} e_{n}^{\\mu},\n        e -> 1/2 e \\bar{\\epsilon}\\Gamma^{m}\\psi_{\\mu} e_{m}^{\\mu} };"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 4780283821124169040,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "latex",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 4780283821124169040,
					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "\\subsection*{Variation of the vielbeine in the Hilbert action}\n\nWe start with the variation of the explicit vielbeine in $\\mathcal{L}^{(2)}$, vN~1.7 eq.~(2)."
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "\\subsection*{Variation of the vielbeine in the Hilbert action}\n\nWe start with the variation of the explicit vielbeine in $\\mathcal{L}^{(2)}$, vN~1.7 eq.~(2)."
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 3599411224642237442,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "input",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 8481275723630444103,
					"cell_origin": "server",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"cells": [
						{
							"cell_id": 9957732519894068813,
							"cell_origin": "server",
							"cell_type": "input_form",
							"source": " -  1/2 e e_{m}^{\\nu} e_{n}^{\\mu} R_{\\mu \\nu}^{m n}"
						}
					],
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{} - \\frac{1}{2}\\,e e_{m}\\,^{\\nu} e_{n}\\,^{\\mu} R_{\\mu \\nu}\\,^{m n}\\end{dmath*}"
				},
				{
					"cell_id": 5546588015077609886,
					"cell_origin": "server",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"cells": [
						{
							"cell_id": 16547866967076756386,
							"cell_origin": "server",
							"cell_type": "input_form",
							"source": " 1/4 R_{\\mu \\nu}^{m n} \\bar{\\epsilon} \\Gamma^{p} \\psi_{\\rho} e e_{m}^{\\mu} e_{n}^{\\nu} e_{p}^{\\rho} -  1/2 R_{\\mu \\nu}^{m n} \\bar{\\epsilon} \\Gamma^{p} \\psi_{\\rho} e e_{m}^{\\mu} e_{n}^{\\rho} e_{p}^{\\nu}"
						}
					],
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{}\\frac{1}{4}\\,R_{\\mu \\nu}\\,^{m n} \\bar{\\epsilon} \\Gamma^{p} \\psi_{\\rho} e e_{m}\\,^{\\mu} e_{n}\\,^{\\nu} e_{p}\\,^{\\rho}\\discretionary{}{}{} - \\frac{1}{2}\\,R_{\\mu \\nu}\\,^{m n} \\bar{\\epsilon} \\Gamma^{p} \\psi_{\\rho} e e_{m}\\,^{\\mu} e_{n}\\,^{\\rho} e_{p}\\,^{\\nu}\\end{dmath*}"
				}
			],
			"source": "dL2:= @(L2);\nvary(dL2, dvb)\ndistribute(dL2)\nsort_product(dL2)\ncanonicalise(dL2)\nrename_dummies(dL2)\ncollect_terms(dL2);"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 1978409198700377821,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "latex",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 1978409198700377821,
					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "This should be equal to\n\\begin{equation*}\n\\delta\\mathcal{L}^{(2)} = \\frac{e}{2}\\big(\\bar\\epsilon\\gamma^\\nu\\psi^a\\big)\\, G_{\\nu a}\\,,\\qquad\nG_{\\nu a} = R_{\\nu a} - \\tfrac12 e_{a\\nu} R\\,,\\qquad R_{\\nu a} = R_{\\mu\\nu ab}\\, e^{b\\mu}\\,.\n\\end{equation*}\nWritten out with all vielbeine explicit, this is"
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "This should be equal to\n\\begin{equation*}\n\\delta\\mathcal{L}^{(2)} = \\frac{e}{2}\\big(\\bar\\epsilon\\gamma^\\nu\\psi^a\\big)\\, G_{\\nu a}\\,,\\qquad\nG_{\\nu a} = R_{\\nu a} - \\tfrac12 e_{a\\nu} R\\,,\\qquad R_{\\nu a} = R_{\\mu\\nu ab}\\, e^{b\\mu}\\,.\n\\end{equation*}\nWritten out with all vielbeine explicit, this is"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 2138589404594887461,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "input",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 1334700269742162545,
					"cell_origin": "server",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"cells": [
						{
							"cell_id": 9388366540881573104,
							"cell_origin": "server",
							"cell_type": "input_form",
							"source": " 1/2 e \\bar{\\epsilon} \\Gamma^{p} \\psi_{\\rho} e_{p}^{\\nu} e_{q}^{\\rho} (R_{\\mu \\nu}^{q r} e_{r}^{\\mu} -  1/2 e^{q}_{\\nu} R_{\\sigma \\lambda}^{s t} e_{s}^{\\lambda} e_{t}^{\\sigma})"
						}
					],
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{}\\frac{1}{2}\\,e \\bar{\\epsilon} \\Gamma^{p} \\psi_{\\rho} e_{p}\\,^{\\nu} e_{q}\\,^{\\rho} \\left(R_{\\mu \\nu}\\,^{q r} e_{r}\\,^{\\mu}\\discretionary{}{}{} - \\frac{1}{2}\\,e^{q}\\,_{\\nu} R_{\\sigma \\lambda}\\,^{s t} e_{s}\\,^{\\lambda} e_{t}\\,^{\\sigma}\\right)\\end{dmath*}"
				},
				{
					"cell_id": 16857450850332051000,
					"cell_origin": "server",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"cells": [
						{
							"cell_id": 13610419571875062544,
							"cell_origin": "server",
							"cell_type": "input_form",
							"source": " -  1/2 R_{\\mu \\nu}^{m n} \\bar{\\epsilon} \\Gamma^{p} \\psi_{\\rho} e e_{m}^{\\mu} e_{n}^{\\rho} e_{p}^{\\nu} +  1/4 R_{\\mu \\nu}^{m n} \\bar{\\epsilon} \\Gamma^{p} \\psi_{\\rho} e e_{m}^{\\mu} e_{n}^{\\nu} e_{p}^{\\rho}"
						}
					],
					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{} - \\frac{1}{2}\\,R_{\\mu \\nu}\\,^{m n} \\bar{\\epsilon} \\Gamma^{p} \\psi_{\\rho} e e_{m}\\,^{\\mu} e_{n}\\,^{\\rho} e_{p}\\,^{\\nu}\\discretionary{}{}{}+\\frac{1}{4}\\,R_{\\mu \\nu}\\,^{m n} \\bar{\\epsilon} \\Gamma^{p} \\psi_{\\rho} e e_{m}\\,^{\\mu} e_{n}\\,^{\\nu} e_{p}\\,^{\\rho}\\end{dmath*}"
				}
			],
			"source": "eins:= 1/2 e \\bar{\\epsilon}\\Gamma^{p}\\psi_{\\rho} e_{p}^{\\nu} e_{q}^{\\rho}\n       ( R_{\\mu\\nu}^{q r} e_{r}^{\\mu} - 1/2 e^{q}_{\\nu} R_{\\sigma\\lambda}^{s t} e_{s}^{\\lambda} e_{t}^{\\sigma} );\ndistribute(eins)\nsubstitute(eins, $e^{q}_{\\nu} e_{q}^{\\rho} -> \\delta_{\\nu}^{\\rho}$)\neliminate_kronecker(eins)\nsort_product(eins)\ncanonicalise(eins)\nrename_dummies(eins);"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 4557488290435542420,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "latex",
			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 4557488290435542420,
					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "The difference with the result of the variation vanishes:"
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "The difference with the result of the variation vanishes:"
		},
		{
			"cell_id": 1993750131607482182,
			"cell_origin": "client",
			"cell_type": "input",
			"cells": [
