			"source": "dpsibar:= @(dL32);\ntake_match(dpsibar, $\\bar{D_{\\mu}{\\epsilon}} A??$);\nsubstitute(dpsibar, $\\bar{D_{\\mu}{\\epsilon}} -> D_{\\mu}{\\bar{\\epsilon}}$);"
