			"source": "substitute(ib, $\\int{A??}{x} -> A??$)\nproduct_rule(ib)\ndistribute(ib)\nsubstitute(ib, $D_{\\mu}{\\Gamma^{m n p}} -> 0$)\nsubstitute(ib, $D_{\\mu}{e} -> e e_{q}^{\\lambda} D_{\\mu}{e^{q}_{\\lambda}}$)\nsubstitute(ib, $D_{\\mu}{e_{m}^{\\nu}} -> - e_{m}^{\\lambda} D_{\\mu}{e^{q}_{\\lambda}} e_{q}^{\\nu}$)\ndistribute(ib);"
