			"source": "curv1:= @(ib);\nsubstitute(curv1, $D_{\\mu}{e^{q}_{\\lambda}} -> 0$)\nsubstitute(curv1, $D_{\\mu}{D_{\\nu}{\\psi_{\\rho}}} -> 1/8 R_{\\mu\\nu}^{m n} \\Gamma_{m n} \\psi_{\\rho}$);"
