					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "This is $-\\frac{e}{2}(\\bar\\psi^\\mu\\gamma^a\\epsilon)G_{a\\mu}$, vN~1.7 eq.~(7). It should\ncancel exactly against the variation of the vielbeine in the Hilbert action,"
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "This is $-\\frac{e}{2}(\\bar\\psi^\\mu\\gamma^a\\epsilon)G_{a\\mu}$, vN~1.7 eq.~(7). It should\ncancel exactly against the variation of the vielbeine in the Hilbert action,"
		},
		{
